		LDA	DEST+0
		CMP	#<VALUE
		ENDM
*
* COMPARE IMMEDIATE WORD
*
CMPIW		MACRO	VALUE,DEST
		LDA	DEST+1
		CMP	#>VALUE
		BNE	?MLBL#
		LDA	DEST+0
		CMP	#<VALUE
?MLBL#
		ENDM
*
* COMPARE BYTES
*
