		LDA	DEST+0
		CMP	SOURCE+0
		ENDM
*
* COMPARE WORDS
*
CMPW		MACRO	SOURCE,DEST
		LDA	DEST+1
		CMP	SOURCE+1
		BNE	?MLBL#
		LDA	DEST+0
		CMP	SOURCE+0
?MLBL#
		ENDM
